igned}5 & -7 & 3 \\\\ 9 & 6 & -1 \\\\ 8 & -1 & -1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =-2\\cdot |\\begin{aligned}5 & -7 & 3 \\\\ 9 & 6 & -1 \\\\ 8 & -1 & -1\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}]}
